iv>\n        <div class=\"seat-label seat-6\">\n          <span class=\"seat-num\">6号位</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Dashed box for seats 7-10 -->\n        <div class=\"dashed-box\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"seat-label seat-7\">\n          <span class=\"seat-num\">7号位</span><br>\n          <span class=\"seat-role\">主陪</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"seat-label seat-8\">\n          <span class=\"seat-num\">8号位</span><br>\n          <span class=\"seat-role\">主陪</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"seat-label seat-9\">\n          <span class=\"seat-num\">9号位</span><br>\n          <span class=\"seat-role\">副主陪</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"seat-label seat-10\">\n          <span class=\"seat-num\">10号位</span><br>\n          <span class=\"seat-role\">副主陪</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Round table with clock -->\n        <div class=\"round-table\">\n          <div class=\"clock-face\">\n            <span class=\"clock-num n12\">12</span>\n            <span class=\"clock-num n1\">1</span>\n            <span class=\"clock-num n2\">2</span>\n            <span class=\"clock-num n3\">3</span>\n            <span class=\"clock-num n4\">4</span>\n            <span class=\"clock-num n5\">5</span>\n            <span class=\"clock-num n6\">6</span>\n            <span class=\"clock-num n7\">7</span>\n            <span class=\"clock-num n8\">8</span>\n            <span class=\"clock-num n9\">9</span>\n            <span class=\"clock-num n10\">10</span>\n            <span class=\"clock-num n11\">11</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 上菜位 box -->\n        <div class=\"shangcai-box\">上菜位</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"text-area\">\n      <h3>最基本的原则</h3>\n      <ol>\n        <li>以右为上（遵循国际惯例）</li>\n        <li>以远为上（远离房门为上）</li>\n        <li>面门为上（良好视野为上）</li>\n      </ol>\n      <p>如果面对门的12点钟是\"上位\"，</p>\n      <p>领导在场：选择9号位或1号位</p>\n      <p>领导不在场：选择7号位或8号位</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"page-number\">2</div>\n\n  <hr class=\"divider\">\n\n  <!-- Section 2: 点餐礼仪 -->\n  <div class=\"section-title\">点餐礼仪</div>\n\n  <div class=\"ordering-layout\">\n    <div class=\"green-arrow\">\n      <div class=\"arrow-line\"></div>\n      <div class=\"arrow-head\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ordering-content\">\n      <h4>餐前了解3个问题：</h4>\n      <p>这顿饭为何吃？这顿饭的预算？来宾的口味和禁忌？</p>\n\n      <h4>提前1小时到达：</h4>\n      <p>放置指引牌等物料，最好拍摄餐厅入口到群聊中作为导航指引</p>\n      <p>布置现场场地，清点座椅数量，调节空调温度</p>\n      <p>找服务员要2份菜单，一份给老板或客户传阅，一份自己用于点单</p>\n\n      <h4>提前30分钟选餐：</h4>\n      <p>假如到了n个客人，菜品分为前菜（凉菜）、热菜（硬菜、花菜、素菜）、主食</p>\n      <p>最合适点菜（n+2）道菜，其中前菜（n/3）道，热菜（n/2）道，以双数为佳</p>\n      <p>假如今晚一共10个人吃饭，共点12道菜，其中3道前菜，热菜5道，1道汤，主食2道，甜品1道</p>\n\n      <div class=\"note-title\">注：</div>\n      <ul>\n        <li>荤素，冷热搭配；荤素6:4，冷热1:2为佳</li>\n        <li>8道菜以上的宴请最好有一道完整的鱼菜</li>\n        <li>尽量不要点龙虾、螃蟹等需要用手抓食，吃相不雅的菜品</li>\n        <li>饭店有特色菜，或当地有出名特产菜可以点，增加和客人介绍的话题</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"page-number\">3</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
